                    {
                        "sense_id": "ca3c7250-d6fe-3580-985e-46b1fd9148b3",
                        "entry_id": "306995f2-a06f-3e4f-99ff-0c8834ab3f26",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A hypothetical world constructed from antimatter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "df0e0cb3-9180-4cbf-bc92-53fc6f6f78c2",
                                "sense_id": "ca3c7250-d6fe-3580-985e-46b1fd9148b3",
                                "text": "But possibly there is an antiworld in which, in addition to matter, time is also negative. […] In such an antiworld man would grow younger with time and a broken glass would come together from its fragments."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24c7c515-cfb9-4c6b-8fd4-d4bf4a5535c5",
                                "sense_id": "ca3c7250-d6fe-3580-985e-46b1fd9148b3",
                                "text": "It follows that somewhere antiworlds consisting of antiparticles are bound to wander. No traces of these antiworlds have as yet been found."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70f999c4-1eb4-417e-890e-4a44ce90a1ca",
                                "sense_id": "ca3c7250-d6fe-3580-985e-46b1fd9148b3",
                                "text": "There could be whole antiworlds and antipeople made out of antiparticles. However, if you meet your antiself, don't shake hands!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
